Open a terminal and navigate to the directory where the file is located.

Run

docker-compose up -d

Check if Kafka and Zookeeper are running:

docker-compose ps

Check existing topics

docker exec -it kafka kafka-topics --list --bootstrap-server localhost:9092

If none, create manually

docker exec -it kafka kafka-topics --create --topic weather_data --bootstrap-server localhost:9092 --partitions 3 --replication-factor 1

Make sure Kafka is running and execute dotnet 

dotnet run

Send a test request (curl or postman)

http://localhost:5057/WeatherForecast/New+York

Read message from Kafka topic

docker exec -it kafka kafka-console-consumer --topic weather_data --from-beginning --bootstrap-server localhost:9092
